{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物动机和前后因果的交代不如Y充分，尤其是他为什么反复收住喜欢、又为什么逐渐改变，Y解释得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键词迅速标出每段心理变化，感受词短而细，且部分随音乐进程出现，观众可以边听边分层捕捉情绪，不必一直读长句。它在水面、光线、身体感受和情绪起伏之间的转换也更细腻，音乐画面感更强。Y的优势是人物动机、心理因果和前后呼应交代得更完整，但长句在短停留段落里增加了阅读负担，部分感受表达也比X概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "57d57d97-2ce7-4bad-b074-6afc71a715b7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T074427265177Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:45:52.911261+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc3f313bfad4eb6897e508827a8ea9a544c436b3006cfd3cc7b908aaf6be4865", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23